  "body": "LOT 1,2,3,4,5,7 SOLD\r\nLOT 6 AVAILABLE \r\n\r\nWelcome to Four Tennyson, a unique and exclusive development of only seven freestanding, brand new homes. From the first impression to the finest detail, these homes stand in a class of their own - elegant in design, exceptional in proportion, and intuitively crafted for modern, coastal living.\r\n\r\nWe invite you to come visit before you miss out. Each home in this development spans up to 260sqm (approx) and offers four spacious bedrooms, each with their own ensuite and wardrobe. On the ground floor you'll find the double garage and dedicated laundry and storage spaces. As well as a large bedroom with an ensuited bathroom and wardrobe - perfect separation for multi generational living or guest accommodation. The middle floor is the heart of the home with the large kitchen, equipped with a butlers pantry, as well as the large open plan living and dining space. Combined with the outdoor living balcony, this floor is where family and friends can get together throughout every season. The top floor offers not only an additional living space and extra storage, but the stunning master room with amazing views, as well as two other generously sized ensuited bedrooms. With a lift that takes you to all floors, these homes truly tick every box. \r\n\r\nEach residence enjoys the independence of being freestanding and on freehold titles, as well as a 10 Year Master Build Guarantee, allowing for confidence, privacy and natural light rarely seen in townhouse developments. The low-maintenance landscaping and modern nature means true lock-up-and-leave convenience, while still offering the scale and comfort of a traditional home. Situated within walking distance of Takapuna Beach and the vibrant local village, residents can enjoy the best of Auckland's North Shore lifestyle - from morning swims and seaside walks to dining and boutique shopping. With the motorway onramp close-by, access to the CBD is effortless, making these homes ideal for professionals, families, and discerning buyers seeking a balance of coastal ease and urban connectivity.\r\n\r\nOpportunities of this calibre are not often available, and developments of this standard even rarer. For those who value design excellence, spacious living, and a location that embodies the very best of Takapuna - this is the address you need to look at.",
